{
  "name": "Like a Fish (Water)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your attunement to the element of water allows you to move within it just as easily as on land. You gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed and you can breathe underwater. If you already have a Swim Speed, that Swim Speed instead increases by 30 feet.</p><p>Additionally, you make any Athletics checks and Saving Throws related to swimming or resisting water-based effects using your Charisma modifier instead of your Strength modifer.</p>",
